+**Formulas:**
+*   **Geometry Loss:** The proxy points are optimized to maximize the Gaussian probability. The loss function is defined as [S1]:
     $$
     L_{Geo} = -\frac{1}{N} \sum_{i=1}^N \psi_{pf}(\rho_i)
     $$
